---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '付款指南——如何在中国付款';
const description = '在飞行前设置支付宝——这涵盖了95%的付款。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 leading-tight">在中国付款</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Set up Alipay before you fly — that covers 95% of payments.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-800">2</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">移动支付应用</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-indigo-800">2</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">设置教程</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-red-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">信用卡指南</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-pink-50 border border-pink-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-pink-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-pink-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">小费指南</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-16 not-prose">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-800">入门指南</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-800 opacity-60">2篇文章</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/zh/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">💰 教程</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">外国人如何设置支付宝</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">下载，用您的国际号码注册，并链接您的外国信用卡。</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">💬 教程</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">外国人如何设置微信支付</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">下载微信，注册，验证您的身份，绑定您的国际卡。</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-800">使用国际卡</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-indigo-800 opacity-60">1条</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/zh/payment/foreign-cards/" class="block bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-800">💳 指南</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">你可以在中国使用外国信用卡吗？</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">在您的Visa或万事达卡实际工作的地方，ATM取款费用。</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-800">常见问题</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-red-800 opacity-60">1 article</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/zh/payment/payment-fails/" class="block bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">🔧 故障排除</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">付款失败时该怎么办</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">常见支付失败原因及分步排查。</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-pink-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-pink-800">小费与文化</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-pink-800 opacity-60">1 article</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/zh/payment/tipping/" class="block bg-pink-50 border border-pink-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-pink-800">🎭 文化</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">中国小费文化：你需要小费吗？</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">不，在中国不需要小费。做什么的快速指南。</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-gray-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">完整指南</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 opacity-60">1 article</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800">📖 概述</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">如何在中国付款：完整指南</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">支付宝、微信支付、现金或信用卡——完整概述。</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5">相关指南</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">中国的交通</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">火车、地铁、出租车和叫车</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">字体中等纹理-900m-0</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">在中国旅行必备的应用程序</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>